---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: Arial, sans-serif
    primaryColor: '#eef5fb'
    primaryBorderColor: '#51718c'
    primaryTextColor: '#243746'
    lineColor: '#526574'
    noteBkgColor: '#fff4df'
    noteTextColor: '#243746'
    noteBorderColor: '#b9a16d'
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    actorMargin: 65
    messageMargin: 28
    noteMargin: 12
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Site as Website / client
    participant API as Runner API and queue
    participant Worker as Processing worker

    Site->>API: Submit job (hashes, profile, expiry)
    opt Missing inputs
        API-->>Site: Request missing inputs
        Site->>API: Reserve and upload inputs
        Site->>API: Resubmit the same job
    end
    API-->>Site: Accepted (job persisted)
    API->>Worker: Schedule job and stage private inputs
    activate Worker
    Note over Worker: Execute within limits<br/>Store output bytes
    Worker-->>API: Completed: output manifest
    deactivate Worker

    Note over API: Retain manifest and outputs<br/>until receipt or retention expiry
    alt Callback delivered
        API->>Site: Authenticated completion callback
    else Callback lost
        Site->>API: Poll job status
        API-->>Site: Completed manifest
    end
    Site->>API: Download from selected runner
    API-->>Site: Stream output bytes
    Note over Site: Verify sizes and SHA-256<br/>Install outputs
    Site->>API: Receipt (bounded, best effort)
    Note over API: Release pins and clear manifest<br/>Lost receipt: clean up at expiry
